---
import StatusBadge from './StatusBadge.astro';

const states = ['scheduled', 'sent', 'confirmed', 'canceled', 'no_response', 'failed'] as const;
---

<div class="grid items-end gap-x-16 gap-y-5 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,6fr)_minmax(0,5fr)]">
  <div class="min-w-0">
    <p
      class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-2.5 text-xs leading-[1.2] font-semibold tracking-[0.09em] text-brand uppercase"
    >
      Painel de acompanhamento
    </p>
    <h2
      id="dashboard-title"
      class="max-w-[22ch] font-display text-[clamp(1.875rem,1.35rem+2.3vw,2.5rem)] leading-[1.12] font-semibold tracking-[-0.012em] text-balance md:text-[clamp(2.25rem,1.3rem+2vw,2.875rem)] lg:text-[clamp(2.25rem,1.2rem+1.5vw,2.625rem)]"
    >
      Saiba o que aconteceu com cada agendamento.
    </h2>
  </div>

  <div class="min-w-0">
    <p
      class="mt-4 text-[1.0625rem] leading-[1.6] text-pretty text-dark-green-gray md:mt-5 md:text-[1.125rem] lg:mt-0"
    >
      Consulte o estado, o histórico e a entrega do webhook de cada agendamento. No mesmo painel,
      você configura a conta, a conexão de WhatsApp, o template e o webhook.
    </p>
    <ul class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2" aria-label="Estados do agendamento">
      {states.map((state) => <li><StatusBadge state={state} /></li>)}
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>
